<title>USA: St Paul cattle trade steady/firm - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Paul cattle trade steady/firm - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST PAUL 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Compared to late last week a light offering of slaughter steers and heifers sold steady to firm. - USDA</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers: Few Choice 2-4 1150-1550 lbs 61.00-63.00, few 64.00.</p>
<p>Slaughter Heifers: Few Choice 2-4 950-1250 lbs 59.00-62.00.</p>
</text>
